.TH DMESG 8 "April 2, 2026"
.UC 4
.SH NAME
dmesg \- display the system message buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /sbin/dmesg
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B N.B.:
.B dmesg
is obsoleted by
.IR syslogd (8)
for maintenance of the system error log.
.PP
.B dmesg
displays the contents of the system message buffer.
.SH SEE ALSO
syslogd(8)
.SH HISTORY
.B dmesg 
first appeared in 4.0BSD.
